理大臣は、フェルディナンド・マルコス・フィリピン大統領（H.E. Ferdinand R. Marcos, Jr., President of the Republic of the Philippines）とともに、第4回アジア・ゼロエミッション共同体（AZEC）首脳会合を開催しました。本会合では、エネルギー安全保障、経済成長、脱炭素の同時実現に向けたAZEC2.0への進化を確認する共同声明を発出しました。また、インド、韓国の今次会合への参加を得つつ、パワー・アジアの強化を通じ、日本が産油国とアジア消費国の連携強化を進めていく旨を確認しました。\n\nhttps://t.co/XgQ9uoup4B"}}},"rest_id":"2122667069661761847","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"3504","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2122667069661761847","sortIndex":"2122682497434124284"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","cashtag_attachments":[],"core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":3},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1929442960221028353/I0KsGLtz_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/412940784/1464569515"},"core":{"created_at":"Tue Nov 15 09:24:43 +0000 2011","name":"首相官邸","screen_name":"kantei"},"dm_permissions":{"can_dm":false},"follow_request_sent":false,"has_graduated_access":true,"id":"VXNlcjo0MTI5NDA3ODQ=","is_blue_verified":true,"location":{"location":""},"media_permissions":{"can_media_tag":false},"notifications_settings":{"notifications_enabled":false},"parody_commentary_fan_label":"None","pinned_items":{"tweet_ids_str":["2116017572772766140"]},"possibly_sensitive":false,"privacy":{"protected":false},"professional":{"category":[],"professional_type":"Business","rest_id":"1589269994889957377"},"profile_bio":{"description":"本アカウントは首相官邸の公式アカウントです。日々の総理に関する情報や内閣の重要政策についての情報などをお届けします。","entities":{"description":{},"url":{"urls":[{"display_url":"kantei.go.jp","expanded_url":"https://www